    {
      "executionState": "enabled",
      "id": "note",
      "kind": "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters": {
        "text": "# Flurry · Five coupled smoke streams\nThe generic GPU Program holds 3,600 smoke particles and a half-float frame history. A slow moving star emits two particles into each of five streams per 60 Hz frame. The star and five sparks are invisible guides: every particle is attracted to all sparks, with stronger attraction to its assigned spark. Its color comes from that spark at birth. Only soft motion-blurred smoke quads are drawn, then their light is added to the faded previous frame. A final pass maps the accumulated light to sRGB for Image Output. Width and Height control both rendering and saved images; changing either restarts the simulation. FlurryProgram.metal sits beside this workflow through the Source File port. This is an independently authored reconstruction informed by Calum Robinson’s public Flurry source."
      },
      "resources": {},
      "title": "How the effect is built"
    },
    {
      "executionState": "enabled",
      "id": "primitive-int",
      "kind": "primitive.int",
      "parameters": {
        "value": {
          "$type": "integer",
          "value": 1280
        }
      },
      "resources": {},
      "title": "Output width"
    },
    {
      "executionState": "enabled",
      "id": "primitive-int-2",
      "kind": "primitive.int",
      "parameters": {
        "value": {
          "$type": "integer",
          "value": 800
        }
      },
      "resources": {},
      "title": "Output height"
    },
    {
      "executionState": "enabled",
      "id": "program-text",
      "kind": "primitive.string",
      "parameters": {
        "value": "{\"version\":1,\"parameters\":[\"persistence\",\"brightness\",\"incohesion\",\"spread\"],\"resources\":[{\"name\":\"smoke\",\"kind\":\"buffer\",\"bytes\":230400},{\"name\":\"history\",\"kind\":\"texture\"},{\"name\":\"historyNext\",\"kind\":\"texture\"},{\"name\":\"display\",\"kind\":\"texture\"}],\"initialize\":[{\"kind\":\"compute\",\"function\":\"initializeSmoke\",\"threads\":[3600],\"buffers\":{\"1\":\"smoke\"}}],\"tick\":[{\"kind\":\"compute\",\"function\":\"advanceSmoke\",\"threads\":[3600],\"buffers\":{\"1\":\"smoke\"}},{\"kind\":\"render\",\"vertex\":\"fullscreenVertex\",\"fragment\":\"fadeFragment\",\"target\":\"historyNext\",\"load\":\"clear\",\"vertexCount\":3,\"fragmentTextures\":{\"1\":\"history\"}},{\"kind\":\"render\",\"vertex\":\"smokeVertex\",\"fragment\":\"smokeFragment\",\"target\":\"historyNext\",\"load\":\"load\",\"blend\":\"additive\",\"vertexCount\":6,\"instanceCount\":3600,\"vertexBuffers\":{\"1\":\"smoke\"}}],\"swaps\":[[\"history\",\"historyNext\"]],\"present\":[{\"kind\":\"render\",\"vertex\":\"fullscreenVertex\",\"fragment\":\"presentFragment\",\"target\":\"display\",\"load\":\"clear\",\"vertexCount\":3,\"fragmentTextures\":{\"1\":\"history\"}}],\"output\":\"display\"}"
      },
